{"id": "tech-3", "headline": "Signal limits mobile screenshots over AI agent privacy risk", "source": "TechCrunch", "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/21/signal-restricts-mobile-screenshots-as-it-confronts-existential-threat-of-ai-surveillance/", "published": "2026-11-21", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Signal said Friday it is limiting screenshots inside its app on mobile devices. President Meredith Whittaker called operating systems that build in agentic AI an existential threat to the app's privacy. She wrote that AI agents that scan the screen can capture and store sensitive data in a local database or on a remote server, outside Signal's control, which puts everyone in a conversation at risk. Signal already blocked screenshots of its Windows app by default and now adds similar limits on Android and iOS. Users can turn the setting off, but Whittaker said that would break Signal's privacy guarantees.", "She also admitted the fix is incomplete because AI agents could reach app data in other ways. Source: TechCrunch."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110110111101001100100100111001111111", "10000010000111001110011100101110101000001", "10111010100000000010000111110011001011101", "10111010111110100100001111100101001011101", "10111010111110100101000010111001101011101", "10000010011000001011001011000111101000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000011010000101001110000101100000000", "11110010110000101111010100011111010011101", "11101001111110000101110101100011111111011", "00000010101010101100011110000110011000110", "10001101101111100011001111010010010100011", "11110011111010010101100011010100100001101", "10110000011110000101010000111111001000111", "00101111011100000101000001001101001110011", "01001000001100101001010000111000101011010", "01101110011001010000110101101010110111010", "10001000000110110100111110011100100101000", "11100011001011110000011000110010001010010", "10111101010101101101101100010101001001111", "1110101101011111111111011010011